=== xzgrep ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Look for instances of PATTERN in the input FILEs, using their uncompressed
contents if they are compressed.

OPTIONs are the same as for 'grep'.

Report bugs to <xz@tukaani.org>.


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  xzgrep [OPTION]... [-e] PATTERN [FILE]...


POSITIONALS (2) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  PATTERN
  FILE...


FLAGS (1) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-e
